Package: ivfLFRTFF
Type: Project
Title: Random Forest Model for Low or Failed Fertilization in Conventional IVF
Version: 1.0.0
Date: 2026-11-12
Authors@R: c(
    # TODO: replace the repository URL in CITATION.cff before publishing.
